  "description": "Vjun (or Vijjun) was a dark, almost lifeless planet in the Vjun system, known for its acidic rainfalls. It was also renowned for its expensive hand-woven tunics. It was the location of Bast Castle, a fortress used by Count Dooku, and later a place where Darth Vader studied the dark side of the Force.",
